SUMMARY:Walk—National Spongecake Day—Maggie Valley Starting at McCrack
 en Corner Park
DESCRIPTION:Haywood County Walking Meetup Group\nIt's National Spongecake 
 Day on August 23! If you will walk with me that day\, I will bring some sp
 ongecake snacks to share at the end!\n\nMeet at McCracken Corner Park\, 56
  State Rd 1307\, Waynesville 28785 (Moody Farm Road/State Road 1307 inters
 ects Soco Road twice\; this is the eastern intersection with a traffic lig
 ht further from Maggie Valley). We will meet at 2:00 p.m.\n\n**Note: There
  is no restroom at the start point. Our route will pass a convenience stor
 e\, and there is a restroom about halfway through the walk at Parham Memor
 ial Park. Please plan accordingly.**\n\nDress for the weather\; consider a
  hat and sunscreen. The walk is pretty flat\, all on pavement except for a
  short portion near the end. Tennis shoes are fine\; walking poles aren't 
 needed (although I plan to bring one). Bring *plenty of water* and a prote
 in snack. Dogs are welcome. Strollers are fine.\n\nWe will walk up Soco Ro
 ad to Parham Memorial Park (the western intersection of Moody Farm Road/St
 ate Road 1307 and Soco Road). Then we will walk along Moody Farm Road\, wi
 th one short side excursion\, back to the start point.\n\nHope to see you 
 there!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/haywood-county-walking-meetup-group/e
 vents/315358631/
