SUMMARY:Walk in Waynesville from Mast General to the Rec Center and Back
DESCRIPTION:Haywood County Walking Meetup Group\nMeet at 2:00 in front of 
 Mast General Store\, 63 N. Main St.\, Waynesville NC 28786. The 5 KM/3.1 m
 ile walk goes past public art\, along the Waynesville Greenway\, and more.
 \n\nThere are some hills\, so some may want a walking pole\; sneakers shou
 ld be fine. Dogs are welcome. Strollers should be ok. Bring plenty of wate
 r and a protein snack. Dress appropriately for the weather.\n\nParking is 
 easier a block to either side of Main Street. Mast General Store doesn't h
 ave a public restroom\, but we can direct you to one nearby should you nee
 d it. There are one or two restrooms along the route.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/haywood-county-walking-meetup-group/e
 vents/315603697/
